{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.AppendixSurreals.collatz_substrate_link","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.AppendixSurreals.collatz_substrate_link","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.QuantumObservableUniverse.SubstrateParameter","lean:module:QOU.AppendixSurreals.QCollatz"],"declarations":7,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.skeinModuleArith_fundamental_odd_step","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.skeinModuleArith_fundamental_odd_step","kind":"theorem","line":88,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/AppendixSurreals/collatz_substrate_link.lean#L88-L93","doc":"On the Skein module `𝒮(q) = ℤ[q^{±1}]`, `q = T` is a unit (inverse `T(-1)`),\nso the fundamental odd-step identity holds — the `{q⁻¹, 1+q⁻¹}` cycle is\nrealised in the actual Skein module. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.skeinModuleArith_qi2","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.skeinModuleArith_qi2","kind":"theorem","line":84,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/AppendixSurreals/collatz_substrate_link.lean#L84-L85","doc":"On the Skein module the q-integer is `[2]_q = T + 1` (`q + 1` with `q = T`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.skeinModuleArith","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.skeinModuleArith","kind":"def","line":78,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/AppendixSurreals/collatz_substrate_link.lean#L78-L81","doc":"**C8 brick 3 — the Skein-Collatz arithmetic on `𝒮(q) = ℤ[q^{±1}]`**, with `q`\nthe module indeterminate `T`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.fundamental_odd_step_at","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.fundamental_odd_step_at","kind":"theorem","line":52,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/AppendixSurreals/collatz_substrate_link.lean#L52-L61","doc":"**The substrate makes the fundamental 2-cycle honest.** Because the substrate\nfield is strictly positive (`field_pos`), `q(p)` is invertible, so the\nfundamental odd-step identity holds at `qinv = q(p)⁻¹`: the `{q⁻¹, 1+q⁻¹}`\ncycle of the Skein-Collatz map is realised by the substrate value itself. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.skein_divisibility_at","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.skein_divisibility_at","kind":"theorem","line":44,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/AppendixSurreals/collatz_substrate_link.lean#L44-L50","doc":"The Skein divisibility `[3]_q = q·[2]_q + 1` holds for the substrate value —\na direct consequence of brick 1, now anchored at `q = q(p)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ArchimedeanSubstrateField.toSkeinCollatzArith_q","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ArchimedeanSubstrateField.toSkeinCollatzArith_q","kind":"theorem","line":40,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/AppendixSurreals/collatz_substrate_link.lean#L40-L42","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ArchimedeanSubstrateField.toSkeinCollatzArith","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ArchimedeanSubstrateField.toSkeinCollatzArith","kind":"def","line":30,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/AppendixSurreals/collatz_substrate_link.lean#L30-L38","doc":"**C8 brick 2 — the Skein-Collatz arithmetic is the QOU substrate parameter.**\nA `ArchimedeanSubstrateField M` at a point `p` furnishes the substrate field `q(p)`;\nthis is the `q` of the induced `SkeinCollatzArith` over `ℝ`. Every brick-1\nidentity (`skein_divisibility`, `contraction_gap`, `coprime`,\n`fundamental_odd_step`) therefore holds for the substrate value, by\nconstruction. ","signatureChunk":0}]}